{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Stage Executor 纯度：禁止持久化与 HTTP 上下文渗入",
  "executorPathGlobs": [
    "src/**/execution/*-executor.service.ts",
    "src/decision/stages/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "forbiddenImportPatterns": [
    "@nestjs/common.*Req\\b",
    "express\\.",
    "fastify\\.",
    ".*Repository\\.save",
    "PrismaService.*\\$transaction",
    "persistDso",
    "feedbackPersistence.*persist"
  ],
  "allowedExceptions": [
    "src/decision/kernel/decision-kernel.service.ts",
    "src/decision/kernel/state-manager.service.ts"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ResearchExecutor 等可调用 skills/registry，但不应成为「唯一权威 DSO 持久化」入口",
    "具体禁止列表随 Phase B ESLint 收紧"
  ]
}
